Package: querencia-hintergruende
Architecture: all
Description: Querencia Desktop backgrounds (alpha)
 Sixteen desktop backgrounds of Querencia Desktop, a classic desktop in the
 style of GNOME 2: twelve motifs (deep blue, blue-green, blue glow, ember,
 hills, coast, dunes, lake, desert, mountains, beach, glass) and four
 variants with the Querencia logo, each as 2560x1440 and as 4:3 picture.
 Deep blue ("tiefblau") is the default background of the desktop.
 .
 The pictures were generated with FLUX1.1 [pro] Ultra through fal.ai and
 are licensed CC-BY-SA-4.0; the logo variants carry the Querencia logo,
 which is not covered by the licence.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
